    "text": "In an A.P., the sixth term <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. If the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math> is the greatest, then the common difference of the A.P., is equal to",
