  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math> is greatest.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>34</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>68</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/55534d98-30fa-4a4b-a436-b55039eb0a36.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 72px;\"/></p><p>So,  the function attains maxima at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
